    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Werewolf</strong> is an intense action-survival game where you become a cursed beast, doomed to transform under the full moon. When night falls, your hunger for blood takes over\u2014eliminate enough victims to stave off the curse, or risk being consumed by it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the hunt won\u2019t always be easy. As your reign of terror grows, the villagers may begin to fight back, forming a resistance with torches, traps, and weapons to defend themselves. If your killings draw too much attention, the kingdom may even send skilled knights to hunt you down, forcing you into brutal, high-stakes battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amid the chaos, you may uncover the truth behind your curse. Who did this to you\u2014and why? Will you seek revenge, hunting down the one responsible? Or will you succumb to the monster within, becoming the nightmare the world fears? The choice is yours, but the moon always rises again.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Werewolf</strong> is an intense action-survival game where you become a cursed beast, doomed to transform under the full moon. When night falls, your hunger for blood takes over\u2014eliminate enough victims to stave off the curse, or risk being consumed by it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the hunt won\u2019t always be easy. As your reign of terror grows, the villagers may begin to fight back, forming a resistance with torches, traps, and weapons to defend themselves. If your killings draw too much attention, the kingdom may even send skilled knights to hunt you down, forcing you into brutal, high-stakes battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amid the chaos, you may uncover the truth behind your curse. Who did this to you\u2014and why? Will you seek revenge, hunting down the one responsible? Or will you succumb to the monster within, becoming the nightmare the world fears? The choice is yours, but the moon always rises again.</p>",
    "short_description": "The Werewolf is a thrilling survival game where you transform into a bloodthirsty beast under the full moon. Hunt and eliminate victims to satisfy the curse\u2014fail, and it consumes you instead. Will you embrace the monster within or struggle to survive the night?",
